PROJECT NAME:
Aetherion MasterCore

REPO NAME:
Aetherion-MasterCore

PROJECT TYPE:
Java / JavaFX / Gradle

MAIN GOAL:
Build Aetherion MasterCore as the main Java-based master application. This replaces the earlier Python master-app idea. Aetherion MasterCore is a futuristic offline-first AI control hub, master dashboard, local utility system, and modular runtime environment.

IMPORTANT:
Start from a clean GitHub repo.
Assume no previous context.
Everything important is written in this prompt.

DO NOT build this in Python.
Use Java + JavaFX.

==================================================
CORE IDENTITY
==================================================

Aetherion MasterCore is:
- the master application
- Java-based
- Windows-first
- offline-first
- modular
- expandable
- designed for Control Prime and Arctic Prime
- eventually able to manage local AI tools, character systems, profiles, utilities, and automation

Visual style:
- dark cyber/offline-AI dashboard
- cyan/amber accents
- rounded panels
- gradient cards
- sci-fi control hub feel
- readable dark mode
- no white text boxes
- no bright default JavaFX styling

