==================================================
DEVICE TARGETS
==================================================

Control Prime:
- main PC
- full master system
- heavier processing allowed
- local AI tools stored here
- development/build machine
- GitHub/Codex integration
- full/dev mode

Arctic Prime:
- laptop
- portable control hub
- lightweight runtime
- offline-first
- low RAM/CPU usage
- fast startup
- tablet/foldable mode support
- floating keyboard support
- local tools only unless user enables more

Do not force heavy systems on Arctic Prime.

==================================================
GITHUB / REPO RULES
==================================================

Create a clean GitHub-safe project.

Include .gitignore for:
- build/
- out/
- .gradle/
- .idea/
- *.iml
- temp files
- generated EXE output if needed

Do not commit broken generated files.

Recommended structure:

src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/ui/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/ui/dashboard/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/core/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/ai/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/systems/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/developer/
src/main/java/com/dev/aetherion/utils/

src/main/resources/com/dev/aetherion/
src/main/resources/com/dev/aetherion/styles/
src/main/resources/com/dev/aetherion/views/

res/
res/Docs/
res/Exe/
res/Config/
res/Data/

Required files:
- build.gradle
- settings.gradle
- README.md
- .gitignore
- AetherionApplication.java
- AetherionDashboardController.java
- Aetherion.fxml
- styles/Main.css
- res/Docs/UI_LOCK.md
- res/Docs/JavaFX_CSS_Notes.md
- res/Docs/Roadmap.md
- res/Docs/Device_Targets.md

==================================================
UI LOCK RULE
==================================================

After the main shell is created, treat it as protected.

Do NOT redesign the entire UI unless the user explicitly requests it.

Allowed:
- functionality
- backend logic
- controller wiring
- section content inside center workspace
- bug fixes
- small readability fixes
- scroll fixes
- responsiveness fixes

Not allowed without explicit user approval:
- changing global layout
- moving sidebar
- moving top bar
- moving right rail
- changing whole theme
- replacing dashboard identity
- major visual redesign

