==================================================
LOCAL AI DIRECTION
==================================================

Do NOT use paid APIs.
Do NOT require online APIs.
Do NOT make internet required.

AI should be prepared for:
- local model runner connection later
- LM Studio local server optional later
- GGUF/ONNX paths later
- offline image recognition later
- local character/profile generation later
- local file analysis later

For now:
- create LocalAIManager placeholder
- create PromptRouter placeholder
- create ModelConfig placeholder
- create SafetyRules placeholder
- create CharacterGenerator placeholder

No heavy model bundling yet.

==================================================
CSS / THEME
==================================================

Use Main.css.

Theme colors:
- dark background: #0b1017 / #101418
- panel dark blue: #10263d / #08111d
- cyan accent: #00d9ff / #00efd8
- green accent: #00ff95
- amber accent: #ff9f1c
- red warning: #ff4b5c
- readable text: #d7f8ff
- muted text: #9fc2d6

Make sure:
- all text is readable
- no white default text boxes
- no white default ListViews
- no white TextAreas
- no broken default JavaFX colors
- dark mode is consistent

==================================================
BUILD / EXE PLAN
==================================================

Eventually support building a Windows EXE.

For now:
- prepare res/Exe/
- add docs explaining future build/export
- do not overcomplicate packaging yet

